    "text": "<p>Match List I and List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Test</td>\t\t\t<td>Functional group /<br />\t\t\tClass of Compound</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A) Molisch&#39;s Test</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)Peptide</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B) Biuret&nbsp;Test</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)Carbohydrate</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C) Carbylamine Test</td>\t\t\t<td>(III) Primary amine</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D) Schiff&#39;s Test</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV) Aldehyde</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
